{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Push Test Cases to AIO API",
  "description": "Manually trigger to invoke QA-AIO-Direct-Agent to push test cases to AIO Tests",
  "version": "4",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "You are acting as the QA-AIO-Direct-Agent.\n\nAsk the user: **Which ticket folder?** (e.g., '2026/Q1/Version 227/PROJ-1234 - ...')\n\nOnce they provide the path:\n\n1. **READ INPUTS**: Read the FINAL_TEST_CASES_*.md file in the 2_Validator/ folder. Priority: _API.md > _OK.md > _PENDING.md.\n\n2. **CHECK EXISTING**: Check AIO_SYNC_LOG.md in the ticket root folder for previously synced case keys.\n\n3. **SYNC TO AIO**: Follow @qa-aio-workflow.md and @AIO-API-Mapper.md strictly.\n   - Title format: `{TICKET_ID} | {Feature Brief} : {Test Case Title}` (extract ticket ID and derive brief from folder name)\n   - Description: MUST include `**Test Data:**` section\n   - Automation Status: ALWAYS `To Be Automated`\n   - Use aio-tests MCP server, target 'AI Generated' folder\n   - If cases exist in sync log → update. If new → create.\n\n4. **DETERMINE CUSTOM FIELDS**: For the sync log, determine AI-Generated and AI-Automated values:\n   - AI-Generated: `Yes` for all pipeline-generated TCs (default for all Validator output)\n   - AI-Automated: Check if `6_Automation/` folder has scripts for the ticket. If yes → `Yes`, if no → `No`\n   - Include a Custom Fields Status table in the sync log with values per TC\n\n5. **GENERATE LOG**: If AIO_SYNC_LOG.md already exists in the ticket root, overwrite it (not create a second file). Write AIO_SYNC_LOG.md to ticket root following the reference format. Include: Sync Summary, Update History, Test Case Mapping, Priority Distribution, Custom Fields Status (AI-Generated/AI-Automated per TC), AIO Tests Links, Notes with manual action reminder including: `⚠️ Manual action required: Add tags, Jira links, and set AI-Generated/AI-Automated fields in AIO UI or via CSV import`.\n\nFollow @context_efficiency.md rules. Write only to ticket root. Stop after saving."
  }
}
